MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Fab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Fab_m01_001: You must be satisfied, no? All your desires have\nbeen attained.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Fab_m01_002: But as for me, I am not content. In fact, I cannot put\nthis feeling to words.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Fab_m01_003: I can only imagine there are no beings in this land\nstronger than Mars, the Bringer of War.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Fab_m01_004: Once you fight him, what need will you have to\ntravel this land with me?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Fab_m01_005: The match need only conclude for us to see...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Fab_m01_006: And then I shall have to ponder what to do next.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Fab_m01_007: Until then, I will do my utmost to aid you, of course.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c12_Fab_m01: <BLN>My mind is not quiet.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Esm_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Esm_m01_001: I never thought we'd face a god!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Esm_m01_002: It'll be fine. Just remember that I always do my best\nfor you, Sweetie.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Esm_m01_003: And that ancestor of mine who came from the sea...\nShe's watching over us too.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Esm_m01_004: After all, she passed her strength to me\nwith Grasitha.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c12_Esm_m01: <BLN>I'm going to do my best!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Mic_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Mic_m01_001: Challenging a god is reckless enough...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Mic_m01_002: But the fact that Mars accepted the challenge means\nthat he's got no more sense than you do!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Mic_m01_003: Or is it that you two have some...connection?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Mic_m01_004: Whatever it is, I'll stick with you. No matter how far\nyou go!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c12_Mic_m01: <BLN>Two peas in a pod, I guess.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Set_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Set_m01_001: You dared to challenge a god of this land? You\nperplex me to the extreme.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Set_m01_002: Why do you repeat your Fódlan ancestor's follies\nfrom long ago...in this age?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Set_m01_003: In the Dagdan pantheon, the god of war, Mars,\nhas extraordinary power.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Set_m01_004: I assure you, no matter how strong you are, you'll be\nno match for him.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_Set_m01_005: In any case, come back alive. I would miss the\nopportunity to lecture you more.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c12_Set_m01: <BLN>Come back alive.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_B01_m01_001: A mortal? Challenging the Bringer of War? Never\nthought I'd see the day...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_B01_m01_002: Dietrich, your bravery has earned my respect.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_B01_m01_003: The match begins on {SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=Month} {DateTime=Day}{SetColor=Default}. Please, come\nback on the appointed day.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c12_B01_m01: <BLN>You've earned my respect!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_B01_m02: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_B01_m02_003: Soon we'll learn who will emerge victorious. Just say\nthe word and we'll get started!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c12_B01_m02: <BLN>You've earned my respect!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_B02_m01_001: Dietrich? I know your next match is special. I wish\nyou well.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_B02_m01_002: I...I've been thinking. About how I really feel.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_B02_m01_003: Do you know what I realized?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_B02_m01_004: My love for you is genuine. So I will be there to\ncheer you on.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c12_B02_m01_005: Take this. As always, I will pray for your safety.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c12_B02_m01: <BLN>You have my love.